{
  "id": "E015",
  "title": "Apple Announces New iPhone and Watchband",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2016-04-17",
  "synopsis": "In the end of March 2016, Apple announced a new iPhone and Apple Watch. Let's see what Chinese netizens had to say about this.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/110/a6197812bfc3f5db724c020d01b8a01e9a555dcc.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "苹果发布新款手机和表带\n\n    苹果在2016年3月21日发布了iPhone SE和新的Apple Watch表带。iPhone SE拥有和6S一样的64位A9芯片，同时价格与5S一样，被称为最强大的4英寸手机。但是网友们似乎并不喜欢这次的发布会，以下是他们的评论：\n- 苹果会在今年秋天发布iPhone VEN，这样你就可以获得一个iPhone SEVEN.\n- 科技以人为本（Nokia）。科技以换表带为本（Apple）。\n- iPhone S(am)E！！ 太好了！",
    "traditional": "蘋果發布新款手機和錶帶\n\n    蘋果在2016年3月21日發布了iPhone SE和新的Apple Watch錶帶。iPhone SE擁有和6S一樣的64位A9芯片，同時價格與5S一樣，被稱為最強大的4英寸手機。但是網友們似乎並不喜歡這次的發布會，以下是他們的評論：\n- 蘋果會在今年秋天發布iPhone VEN，這樣你就可以獲得一個iPhone SEVEN.\n- 科技以人為本（Nokia）。科技以換錶帶為本（Apple）。\n- iPhone S(am)E！！ 太好了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Apple Announces New iPhone and Watchband"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "苹果在2016年3月21日发布了iPhone SE和新的Apple Watch表带。",
      "traditional": "蘋果在2016年3月21日發布了iPhone SE和新的Apple Watch錶帶。",
      "pinyin": "píng guǒ zài 4 nián 1 yuè 3 rì fā bù le 4 hé xīn de 3 biǎo dài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "iPhone SE拥有和6S一样的64位A9芯片，同时价格与5S一样，",
      "traditional": "iPhone SE擁有和6S一樣的64位A9芯片，同時價格與5S一樣，",
      "pinyin": "4 yōng yǒu hé 2 yí yàng de 3 wèi 2 xīn piàn tóng shí jià gé yǔ 2 yí yàng",
      "english": "On March 21st 2016, Apple announced the iPhone SE and a new watchband for the Apple Watch."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "被称为最强大的4英寸手机。",
      "traditional": "被稱為最強大的4英寸手機。",
      "pinyin": "bèi chēng wéi zuì qiáng dà de 1 yīng cùn shǒu jī",
      "english": "The iPhone SE offers the same 64-bit A9 chip offered in the iPhone 6s and has the same price as the iPhone 5S."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "但是网友们似乎并不喜欢这次的发布会，以下是他们的评论：",
      "traditional": "但是網友們似乎並不喜歡這次的發布會，以下是他們的評論：",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì wǎng yǒu men sì hū bìng bù xǐ huan zhè cì de fā bù huì yǐ xià shì tā men de píng lùn",
      "english": "It's the most powerful phone with a 4-inch display."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But many internet users did not take a liking to the conference. Here are their comments:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "- 苹果会在今年秋天发布iPhone VEN，这样你就可以获得一个iPhone SEVEN.",
      "traditional": "- 蘋果會在今年秋天發布iPhone VEN，這樣你就可以獲得一個iPhone SEVEN.",
      "pinyin": "píng guǒ huì zài jīn nián qiū tiān fā bù 5 zhè yàng nǐ jiù kě yǐ huò dé yí ge 4",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "- Apple will introduce their iPhone VEN this fall. So you will have a iPhone SEVEN."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "- 科技以人为本（Nokia）。科技以换表带为本（Apple）。",
      "traditional": "- 科技以人為本（Nokia）。科技以換錶帶為本（Apple）。",
      "pinyin": "kē jì yǐ rén wéi běn kē jì yǐ huàn biǎo dài wéi běn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "- Connecting people (Nokia). Connecting watchband (Apple)."
