    "sentence_translations": [
      "Apple Announces New iPhone and Watchband",
      "",
      "On March 21st 2016, Apple announced the iPhone SE and a new watchband for the Apple Watch.",
      "The iPhone SE offers the same 64-bit A9 chip offered in the iPhone 6s and has the same price as the iPhone 5S.",
      "It's the most powerful phone with a 4-inch display.",
      "But many internet users did not take a liking to the conference. Here are their comments:",
      "",
      "- Apple will introduce their iPhone VEN this fall. So you will have a iPhone SEVEN.",
      "",
      "- Connecting people (Nokia). Connecting watchband (Apple).",
      "",
      "- iPhone S(am)E!! Amazing!"
    ]
